---
description: Git Flow branches, naming, and where to branch from for VitaForge
alwaysApply: false
---

- Do not commit or push unless the user asks.
- Features: `git checkout -b feature/<short-desc> develop`
- Releases: `release/<version>` from `develop`
- Hotfixes: `hotfix/<version>-<issue>` from `main`
- Merge to `main` through a PR. Full table and diagram: @AGENTS.md
